## Summary

Add an independent embedded-audit CI workflow (.github/workflows/embedded-audit.yml) that runs the auditor router under a separate least-privilege token with verifiable provenance (run id, commit SHA, actor) and emits the embedded_audit proof object, plus an in-lane invocation entrypoint. The merge engine may REQUEST but never AUTHOR the audit proof.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not add secrets without supervisor sign-off. Do not use pull_request_target for PR-controlled code. Do not grant the merge engine write access to the proof location.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

